    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'Move the belt to whichever hand is free: pistol in the left hand puts
        mags on the right, holding only the front grip of a rifle puts them on the
        trigger-hand side. Both hands busy or both free keeps the last side. Flip
        Belt is the starting side.'
